require.go:794: \r\n                    \tError Trace:\tfstests.go:1029\r\n                    \tError:      \tReceived unexpected error:\r\n                    \t            \tcan't move directory - incompatible remotes\r\n                    \t            \tgithub.com/ncw/rclone/fs.init\r\n                    \t            \t\t/home/ncw/go/src/github.com/ncw/rclone/fs/fs.go:49\r\n                    \t            \tgithub.com/ncw/rclone/backend/onedrive.init\r\n                    \t            \t\t<autogenerated>:1\r\n                    \t            \tmain.init\r\n                    \t            \t\t<autogenerated>:1\r\n                    \t            \truntime.main\r\n                    \t            \t\t/opt/go/go1.11/src/runtime/proc.go:189\r\n                    \t            \truntime.goexit\r\n                    \t            \t\t/opt/go/go1.11/src/runtime/asm_amd64.s:1333\r\n                    \tTest:       \tTestIntegration/FsMkdir/FsPutFiles/FsDirMove\r\n[snip]\r\n```\r\n\r\nCommenting out this bit of code causes it to work\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n--- a/backend/onedrive/onedrive.go\r\n+++ b/backend/onedrive/onedrive.go\r\n@@ -1092,7 +1092,7 @@ func (f *Fs) DirMove(src fs.Fs, srcRemote, dstRemote string) error {\r\n \tif dstDriveID != srcDriveID {\r\n \t\t// https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/api/driveitem-move?view=graph-rest-1.0\r\n \t\t// \"Items cannot be moved between Drives using this request.\"\r\n-\t\treturn fs.ErrorCantDirMove\r\n+\t\t// return fs.ErrorCantDirMove\r\n \t}\r\n \r\n \t// Check destination does not exist\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis change was introduced as part of 49da220b653d7912c5efeaf6b2656c9d704d33ce so relatively recently by @Cnly \r\n\r\nCan you take a look @Cnly ? Thanks :-)","closed_by":{"login":"Cnly","id":3103188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDMxODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3103188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cnly","html_url":"https://github.com/Cnly","followers_url":"ht